{"id":8659,"date":"2023-07-27T18:21:48","date_gmt":"2023-07-27T22:21:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8659"},"modified":"2023-07-27T20:20:12","modified_gmt":"2023-07-28T00:20:12","slug":"back-to-northern-michigan","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/07\/27\/back-to-northern-michigan\/","title":{"rendered":"Back to Northern Michigan"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Although we&#8217;ve hit a lot of our beautiful country over the last six years on the road, it seems that our hearts often lead us back to northern Michigan.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Gilead-to-40-Mile-Map.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"451\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Gilead-to-40-Mile-Map.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8686\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Gilead-to-40-Mile-Map.jpg 451w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Gilead-to-40-Mile-Map-251x300.jpg 251w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 451px) 100vw, 451px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Michigan (the Detroit area) is where Kathy and I were raised, married, bought our first home, and saw our children through their early years in grade school.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our early vacations often involved throwing the kids and the dog in the van and driving up to Kalkaska where Grandma and Grandpa Baldwin had retired to.  It was a low cost trip away from work and the hectic city downstate and provided my mom and dad with a handyman (me) to take care of the list of tasks that dad kept adding to that he could no longer take care of himself.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But when we have the opportunity to revisit the memories in Michigan, we always choose to do so.  We have a lot of fond memories of great times with family and friends.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You might remember that we got off the road in early 2022 to head back to Mt Gilead Ohio from Arizona to help our daughter Sara heal from her sudden serious illness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>That took us through September of &#8217;22 when we could have returned to Arizona for the winter, but we decided we&#8217;d stay in Ohio for the winter and get our hip surgeries completed.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In October of &#8217;22 our son in law Stu wanted to make a fishing trip to northern Michigan so we naturally tagged along in our motorhome and made a family trip of it.  <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/03\/16\/summer-camping-in-michigan-with-friends-and-family\/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"8569\">You can read the post on that trip here<\/a>.  Norm and Alice, our old friends from my Xerox days came along and camped with us.  We all had a great time catching up and telling stories.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Then in December of &#8217;22 Kathy and I both had our hip surgeries.  Mine was a new total right hip with a pretty quick recovery and hers was a torn left hip tendon repair which required nearly two full months of healing and rehab taking us through February of &#8217;23.  By that time we were well into winter and decided we would stay in OH through the summer and into fall &#8217;23 when we would head back to Arizona for the winter.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>To keep from getting bored and to give me a little spending money, during our time in Ohio I work part time for the county transporting patients to medical appointments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Mid June of &#8217;23 we decided to get the coach out of storage and make a trip up to see my sister Betsy and brother in law Bob in Owosso, Michigan.  It&#8217;s about a 5 hour trip.  Since the coach had been in storage for more than a year at this point, we thought it wise to take it on a short shake-down cruise.  And we&#8217;re so glad we did!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>On our way back from Owosso the last 50 miles or so found us in &#8220;limp mode&#8221; barely doing 30 mph. Ugh!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So into the shop she went.  We drove the car back to Mt Gilead and waited (me not so patiently).  Two more shops and three weeks later we finally had a resolution.  Turns out the fuel tank (95 gallons) had a lot of rust and algae in it.  Both are caused by excess moisture sitting in the tank during extended periods of storage.  The rust and algae plugged up not only the fuel filter but the lines as well.  The solution to this problem is to always top off the tank just before placing your rig in storage.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But by mid-July and thanks to Great Lakes Truck Center in Monroeville, Ohio where we were in the shop for about four days waiting on parts. New fuel tank and associated parts.  We finally got back on the road headed to Ludington Michigan.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_133959.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8685\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_133959.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8685\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_133959.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_133959-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_133959-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Replacing the fuel tank<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_161635.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8684\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_161635.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8684\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_161635.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_161635-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230720_161635-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Cleaning lines, new filter, etc.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We then moved on to Ludington to attend an RV rally sponsored by our Escapees RV Club Great Lakes Chapter.  There were about 30 rigs there from all over the tri-state.  We had the opportunity to meet some new friends and visit with &#8220;old&#8221; friends we&#8217;ve met across the country too.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_185559.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"425\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_185559.jpg\" alt=\"Larry &amp; Robyn along with their son (home from college) Caleb\" class=\"wp-image-8666\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_185559.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_185559-300x168.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_185559-685x383.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082546.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8667\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082546.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8667\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082546.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082546-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082546-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_163907.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8668\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_163907.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8668\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_163907.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_163907-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230721_163907-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082427.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8669\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082427.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8669\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082427.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082427-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_082427-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_091545.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8673\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_091545.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8673\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_091545.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_091545-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_091545-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">No, it&#8217;s not our dog!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_081704.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8672\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_081704.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8672\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_081704.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_081704-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230723_081704-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Our site at fairgrounds<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_074025.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8671\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_074025.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8671\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_074025.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_074025-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_074025-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_174322.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8670\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_174322.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8670\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_174322.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_174322-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230722_174322-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">One of the afternoon meetings<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After the Ludington rally we moved 4 hours over to the east side of the state.  We settled in at Alpena where we could stay until Friday morning when the &#8220;weekend warriors&#8221; descend on the campground.  This is a very common occurrence as most folks have only the weekends to take a break with the family and head to the local camp or lake cottage. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_165014.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8675\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_165014.jpg 540w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_165014-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_165014-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230724_165014-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 540px) 100vw, 540px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Our site at Campers Cove, Alpena<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This was a stop to give us time to catch up on our grocery shopping (we have a small 9 cu ft fridge) and find the local laundromat.  We did take a drive over to the Thunder Bay Marina and enjoyed looking at all the yachts along with a large cruise ship in the distance heading south on Lake Huron.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8679\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112959.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8679\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112959.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112959-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112959-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8676\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112511.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8676\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112511.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112511-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112511-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8678\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112430.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8678\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112430.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112430-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112430-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"425\" data-id=\"8677\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112254.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8677\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112254.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112254-300x168.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_112254-685x383.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>As we walked the downtown streets of Alpena we came across a nice little park in between a couple businesses.  I wanted to share this picture of the wall mural.  Note the large 3D fish in the mural!  Pretty cool, eh?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_103154.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8680\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_103154.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_103154-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230725_103154-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We got a really special and pleasant surprise after we arrived here at Alpena.  I had posted on my Facebook page that we were here and almost immediately I received a message from an &#8220;old&#8221; friend of ours when we lived in Redford Twp MI pre-1984.  What a blast from the past!  Tim reached out to us to let us know that he and his wife Nancy now have a home near Harrisville, MI about 40 miles south of here.  We made arrangements to enjoy a beautiful evening re-kindling our friendship over a wonderful dinner at an upscale Italian restaurant in Alpena.  It was great to spend time with them both and we look forward to seeing them again when we will very likely be back up here in a few years.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;m usually pretty good about taking pictures, but we were so busy talking that I totally forgot &#8211; my bad.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We were intending to move tomorrow morning over to Emerick Park Campground at Hillman MI while we wait until we can get into our spot at the lighthouse, but I just got an email from our supervisor at the lighthouse and he has an empty spot now so we are going to head on up to 40 Mile Point Lighthouse tomorrow.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>More to follow after we settle in up there. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Although we&#8217;ve hit a lot of our beautiful country over the last six years on the road, it seems that our hearts often lead us back to northern Michigan. Michigan (the Detroit area) is where Kathy and I were raised, married, bought our first home, and saw our children through their early years in grade &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/07\/27\/back-to-northern-michigan\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Back to Northern Michigan<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,554707839,406,554707999,554708025,19546,554707329,554707760],"tags":[554708158,554707232,127613,554708164,554708162,554707704,554707660,554707356,11110,554708165,554707494,554708163,3559,554707669],"class_list":["post-8659","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-escapees","category-family","category-repair","category-rving","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","category-volunteering","tag-alpena","tag-camping","tag-escapees","tag-fuel-tank","tag-harrisville","tag-herbnkathy","tag-herbsells","tag-ludington","tag-michigan","tag-monroeville","tag-motorhome","tag-repair-shop","tag-rv","tag-rv-club"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8659","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8659"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8659\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8687,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8659\/revisions\/8687"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8659"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8659"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8659"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}